#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"A real-time recreation of Eric Graham's 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\" demo: a GLSL\n"
"port of his recursive ray tracer. The robot, the balls, the checkerboard\n"
"floor and the mirror reflections are all generated and raytraced "
"procedurally.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Een real-time reproductie van Eric Graham's Amiga \"Juggler\"-demo uit 1987: "
"een GLSL\n"
"poort van zijn recursieve raytracer. De robot, de ballen, het dambord\n"
"vloer- en spiegelreflecties worden allemaal gegenereerd en procedureel "
"geraytraced.\n"
"\n"
"Geschreven door Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "

