msgid "Esper"
msgstr "Esper"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/esper.xml.h:10
msgid ""
"\n"
"\"Enhance 224 to 176. Pull out track right. Center in pull back.  Pull\n"
"back. Wait a minute. Go right. Stop. Enhance 57 19. Track 45 left.\n"
"Gimme a hardcopy right there.\"\n"
"\n"
"The Esper Machine was a voice-controlled forensic device used by LAPD\n"
"in 2019, as documented in the 1982 film, Blade Runner.  It was capable\n"
"of enhancing photographs to an extreme degree, including reconstructing\n"
"different viewpoints within the space from the reflections on various\n"
"objects in the photograph.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2017.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\"Verbeter 224 naar 176. Trek de rupsband naar rechts uit. Centreer naar "
"achteren. Trek\n"
"terug. Wacht even. Ga rechts. Stop. Verbetering 57 19. Spoor 45 links.\n"
"Geef mij daar maar een hardcopy.\"\n"
"\n"
"De Esper Machine was een stemgestuurd forensisch apparaat dat door de LAPD "
"werd gebruikt\n"
"in 2019, zoals gedocumenteerd in de film Blade Runner uit 1982.  Het was "
"capabel\n"
"van het in extreme mate verbeteren van foto's, inclusief reconstructie\n"
"verschillende gezichtspunten binnen de ruimte vanuit de reflecties op "
"verschillende\n"
"objecten op de foto.\n"
"\n"
"Geschreven door Jamie Zawinski; 2017.\n"
"  "

