#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Generates an infinitely-scrolling sequence of dazzle camouflage patterns.\n"
"\n"
"Dazzle Ships, in addition to being the best album by Orchestral\n"
"Manoeuvres in the Dark, were military vessels during World War I and\n"
"early in World War II that were painted not to conceal but to confuse:\n"
"with these Cubist overlapping stripes, it was very hard to estimate\n"
"their size, range and heading.  This was a big deal before the\n"
"invention of Radar.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dazzle_camouflage\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cubism\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dazzle_Ships_%28album%29\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acoustic_mirror\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radar\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2018.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Genereert een oneindig scrollende reeks verblindende camouflagepatronen.\n"
"\n"
"met deze kubistische overlappende strepen was het erg moeilijk in te "
"schatten\n"
"hun grootte, bereik en koers.  Dazzle Ships is naast het beste album van "
"Orchestral\n"
"Dit was een groot probleem vóór de\n"
"Manoeuvres in the Dark waren militaire schepen tijdens de Eerste "
"Wereldoorlog\n"
"uitvinding van radar.aan het begin van de Tweede Wereldoorlog die niet "
"werden geschilderd om te verbergen maar om te verwarren:\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dazzle_camouflage\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cubism\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dazzle_Ships_%28album%29\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acoustic_mirror\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radar\n"
"\n"
"Geschreven door Jamie Zawinski; 2018.\n"
"  "

